From bbefd4098de71df4e2ffff6f4aaaad8171cc5b07 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nathan Schonegg <nschonegg@banning-eng.com>
Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 18:45:34 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] Add CaveCAD branding: new logo, app icon, and splash
 screen

Replace the stock QCAD splash and icons with the CaveCAD survey-line
identity: a plan-view traverse mark with station circles and an
orange end-station accent.

- scripts/splashscreen.png / @2x: new 375x248 / 750x496 splash
- scripts/qcad_icon.png / .svg: window icon (C-shaped traverse mark)
- src/run/qcad.icns: macOS app icon, 16-1024 px
- support/logo, support/splashscreen: editable SVG/HTML sources

Windows qcad.ico not yet regenerated.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
